  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Future Entrepreneurs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a Futuros Empresarios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a incrementar la inversin privada en actividades de innovacin. El objetivo especfico es aumentar la cantidad de nuevos emprendimientos innovadores y exitosos en Uruguay.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to help boost private investment in innovation activities. The specific objective is to increase the number of new and successful innovative business ventures in Uruguay.</narrative>
  </description>
